| `src/harle/search/` | `docs/trd/architecture/search.md` (and data.md §3) | `docs/current_state/architecture/search.md` |
| `src/harle/orchestrator/` | `docs/trd/architecture/orchestrator.md` | `docs/current_state/architecture/orchestrator.md` |
